  "title": "Safety and Accuracy of Stereoelectroencephalography for Pediatric Patients with Prior Craniotomy",
  "description": "BIDS-formatted intracranial EEG dataset of stereoelectroencephalography (SEEG) electrode data from pediatric patients with prior craniotomy. The data support an analysis of the safety and accuracy of SEEG in this population. Electrode coordinates are given in each individual's native post-operative CT space, with no alignment to other imaging modalities or standardized atlases.",
